==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 66 seconds<sup>1,980f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 65.33 seconds<sup>1,960f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[SSS Monkey King (Enemy)|SSS Monkey King]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**5 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.

==Strategy==
It's advised to get rid of the peons in this level before focusing on SSS Monkey King himself. You can try and lure him to your base so you won't have to deal with THE SLOTH.

